[{"answer":"Excuse me, Dr Johnson.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/1.mp3"},{"answer":"May I speak to you for a minute?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure. Come in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm Melanie Griffin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm taking your course in Population Studies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. Well, Melanie, how can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm having a bit of trouble with the second assignment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's due in 12 days.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/8.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of trouble are you having?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Is the assignment question a problem?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's part of the problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm also having - been having trouble getting hold of the books.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/12.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been to the library several times, and all the books are out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds like you should have started borrowing books a bit earlier.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I had a really big assignment due in for another course, and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been spending all my time on that, and I thought...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/16.mp3"},{"answer":"You might get an extension of time to finish your assignment for me?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/17.mp3"},{"answer":"If that's possible, but I don't know...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, yes, it is possible, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/19.mp3"},{"answer":"extensions are normally given only for medical or compassionate reasons,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/20.mp3"},{"answer":"otherwise, it's really a question of organising your study,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and we don't like giving extensions to students who simply didn't plan their work properly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/22.mp3"},{"answer":"What did you get for your first assignment?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I got 87%.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you did very well indeed,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/25.mp3"},{"answer":"so obviously, you can produce good work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think I'll need too much extra time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/27.mp3"},{"answer":"as long as I can get hold of some of the important references.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, since you did so well in your first assignment,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm prepared to give you an extra two weeks for this one,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/30.mp3"},{"answer":"so that'll mean you'll need to submit it about a month from now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what about the reading materials?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you checked out the journal articles in the list?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Umm, no, not yet,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/35.mp3"},{"answer":"there were about 20 of them, and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I wasn't sure which ones would be most useful or important.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, they're all useful,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/38.mp3"},{"answer":"but I don't expect anyone to read them all, because a number of them deal with the same issues.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me give you some suggestions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/40.mp3"},{"answer":"The article by Anderson and Hawker is really worth reading.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, I'll read that one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/42.mp3"},{"answer":"You should also read the article by Jackson,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/43.mp3"},{"answer":"but just look at the part on the research methodology - how they did it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Jackson, got that...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/46.mp3"},{"answer":"And if you have time, the one by Roberts says very relevant things,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/47.mp3"},{"answer":"although it's not essential.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, if it's useful, I'll try and read that one...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, the one by Morris.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/50.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't bother with that at this stage, if I were you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, I won't bother with Morris.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, now, someone told me the article by Cooper is important.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, yes, in a way,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/54.mp3"},{"answer":"but just look at the last part, where he discusses the research results.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/55.mp3"},{"answer":"And lastly, there's Forster -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I can't think why I included that one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/57.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not bad and could be of some help, but not that much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, let's deal with the assignment question.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/59.mp3"},{"answer":"What's the problem there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/60.mp3"},{"answer":"It's the graph on page two.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/61.mp3"},{"answer":"What seems to be the problem? It's just the bar graph showing reasons why people change where they live.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I've got a photocopy but the reasons at the bottom are missing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Look at the first bar on the graph -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/65.mp3"},{"answer":"now that indicates the number of people who move because they want more space.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh I see...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/67.mp3"},{"answer":"bar one... okay...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Now what about the next bar?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Bar two is to do with the people living nearby disturbing them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/70.mp3"},{"answer":"so they chose to move away to somewhere quieter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Now let's look at bar number three...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/72.mp3"},{"answer":"another reason people change their place of living","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/73.mp3"},{"answer":"is because they want to be closer to the city.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Proximity to the city is an issue...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, bar number four refers to problems when the owner of the property won't help fix things that go wrong.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/77.mp3"},{"answer":"In other words, the owner is not helpful and so the tenants move out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Now what about bar five?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Bar five is about those people who move because...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/81.mp3"},{"answer":"they need a bus or train to get them into the city or to go to work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/83.mp3"},{"answer":"And bar six?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Bar number six is interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/85.mp3"},{"answer":"That reason was given quite a lot -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/86.mp3"},{"answer":"people moving because they wanted to be in a more attractive neighbourhood.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes, thank you very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-3-2023-08-10-18-30-38/88.mp3"}]
